117
00:07:48,180 --> 00:07:49,740
No, I need a new trainer!

118
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:50,960
Please, boss!

119
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:52,060
Huh?

120
00:07:52,420 --> 00:07:52,940
