Honorable Grandson!

129
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:15,940
Naruto?

130
00:08:15,941 --> 00:08:18,820
What has he done with the Honorable
Grandson?

131
00:08:20,175 --> 00:08:20,820
Hmm?

132
00:08:20,821 --> 00:08:22,360
