134
00:08:25,460 --> 00:08:28,960
I am a Jōnin, the highest ninja level,
and I'm an official.

135
00:08:28,961 --> 00:08:30,521
I'm the elite trainer of future Hokage.

136
00:08:30,700 --> 00:08:35,520
Any parasite that leeches onto my student
will be squashed!

137
00:08:50,350 --> 00:08:54,330
So, what's up with this obsession you've
got with your grandfather?

138
00:08:58,399 --> 00:09:00,530
My grandfather named me Konohamaru.

139
00:09:00,531 --> 00:09:03,250
