140
00:09:04,599 --> 00:09:06,050
So it should be easy to remember.

141
00:09:08,479 --> 00:09:09,970
But no one calls me that name.

142
00:09:10,030 --> 00:09:11,910
Not one person in the whole village.

143
00:09:12,724 --> 00:09:15,164
That's because when they look at me,
they don't really see me.

144
00:09:15,310 --> 00:09:19,330
All they see is the Honorable Grandson of
the Lord Hokage.

145
00:09:19,850 --> 00:09:21,910
No one knows who I am.

146
00:09:22,970 --> 00:09:24,710
I can't stand it anymore.

147
00:09:24,950 --> 00:09:25,950
It's like I'm invisible.

148
00:09:27,069 --> 00:09:28,069
Like I don't exist.

149
00:09:28,459 --> 00:09:29,459
