I'm learning how to beat my grandfather so
I can get the title.

168
00:10:33,190 --> 00:10:34,190
Hokage!

169
00:10:34,289 --> 00:10:35,670
Now don't get in my way!

170
00:10:36,050 --> 00:10:38,150
A Hokage is more than just a fighter.

171
00:10:38,250 --> 00:10:43,150
He must know virtue, honor, wisdom,
and he must be skilled at a thousand jutsu.

172
