And he could probably get me with it too.

207
00:12:45,050 --> 00:12:47,630
Oh man!

208
00:12:52,510 --> 00:12:55,510
I couldn't even beat that snobby trainer
of mine!

209
00:12:55,511 --> 00:12:59,070
I want to be Hokage so bad, but I keep
messing up!

210
