211
00:13:02,099 --> 00:13:03,430
You really think it's that easy?

212
00:13:04,049 --> 00:13:08,250
To be a Hokage, you have to be the
greatest of all ninjas.

213
00:13:08,799 --> 00:13:11,490
You have to prove yourself so everyone
believes in you.

214
00:13:13,390 --> 00:13:14,390
Look at me!

215
00:13:14,630 --> 00:13:15,990
I've been through a lot already.

216
00:13:16,270 --> 00:13:20,310
I've been ignored, pushed away, and
treated like I had the plague or something.

217
00:13:20,570 --> 00:13:24,350
And after all that, I found one person who
believes in me.

218
00:13:25,550 --> 00:13:28,650
To find that one person, I had to get
knocked down a lot.

219
00:13:29,670 --> 00:13:31,770
So you better make sure that you're ready.

220
00:13:32,070 --> 00:13:33,070
For what?

221
00:13:34,810 --> 00:13:36,170
For lots of sweat.

222
00:13:36,610 --> 00:13:37,610
And tears.

223
00:13:38,370 --> 00:13:40,150
While you're learning to be a ninja.

224
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:52,020
By the way, there is no easy way to
becoming Hokage.

225
00:13:52,500 --> 00:13:53,500
Believe it.

226
00:13:54,260 --> 00:13:54,780
