256
00:16:27,620 --> 00:16:30,860
Hinata, you're the successor of the Hyuga
clan.

257
00:16:31,220 --> 00:16:33,940
This is your chance to show me you're
worthy.

258
00:16:35,060 --> 00:16:36,060
Yes, sir.

259
00:16:39,270 --> 00:16:41,970
But... I'm supposed to fight.

260
00:16:47,180 --> 00:16:48,180
