265
00:17:14,380 --> 00:17:15,380
There!

266
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:34,760
Stop!

267
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:04,180
Falling to Hanabi who's five years
younger!

268
00:18:04,500 --> 00:18:05,500
Enough!

269
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:06,600
Just go!

270
00:18:20,655 --> 00:18:24,590
Hinata will probably just serve the
village as a genin.

271
00:18:26,750 --> 00:18:27,750
Oh, I see.

272
00:18:29,339 --> 00:18:33,970
It seems sad, but we cannot allow a
failure like that to become our successor.

273
00:18:35,169 --> 00:18:36,630
This is her destiny.

274
00:18:39,989 --> 00:18:42,651
That you were born
possessing strength surpassing

275
00:18:42,652 --> 00:18:45,311
that of your elder
sister is also destiny.

276
00:18:45,930 --> 00:18:50,670
Hanabi, you must hone your skills to the
utmost for the sake of the Hyuga.

277
00:18:54,410 --> 00:18:55,410
Yes.

278
00:19:16,679 --> 00:19:18,080
Stand up, Hanabi.

279
00:19:23,489 --> 00:19:25,520
I will take Hinata under my wing.

280
00:19:26,334 --> 00:19:29,200
But are you... are you sure that's what
you want?

281
00:19:31,519 --> 00:19:34,120
She is your firstborn and heir to your
household.

282
00:19:35,044 --> 00:19:38,240
The life of a genin can be dangerous and
brief.

283
00:19:40,429 --> 00:19:41,840
Do whatever you will.

284
00:19:44,215 --> 00:19:47,620
She's of less worth than her sister,
five years her junior.

285
00:19:48,604 --> 00:19:51,100
The Hyuga clan has no use for such an
heir.

286
00:19:53,374 --> 00:19:55,980
Father has turned his back on elder
sister.

287
00:19:57,920 --> 00:20:01,460
If you have nothing more to say,
leave us now.

288
00:20:01,940 --> 00:20:03,400
We have work to do.

289
00:20:04,260 --> 00:20:05,260
All right.

290
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:12,320
Continue, Hanabi!

291
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:14,320
Yes.

292
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:22,680
If elder sister can't do it, I have no
choice but to do it.

293
00:20:22,681 --> 00:20:24,420
I will protect the Hyuga.

294
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:26,860
This is my destiny.

295
00:20:41,489 --> 00:20:44,610
You know, sometimes I wonder if he'll be
okay.

296
00:20:47,809 --> 00:20:49,330
I'm worried that he's just too scared.

297
00:20:49,979 --> 00:20:52,199
I mean, sure, he did
finally become a genin,

298
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:54,811
but he always shies
away from confrontation.

299
00:20:55,424 --> 00:20:59,831
Soon he'll be sent out on missions and may
have to face foes in life or death battles.

300
00:21:00,349 --> 00:21:04,087
And as it is, well, to put
it bluntly, I fear that Choji

301
00:21:04,088 --> 00:21:06,890
will be killed because he's
too scared to make a move.

302
00:21:09,479 --> 00:21:12,510
Frankly, I seriously doubt that he's ever
going to become a chunin.

303
00:21:13,679 --> 00:21:15,070
You're off base about him, Choza.

304
00:21:15,150 --> 00:21:16,430
Your son is not a coward.

305
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:17,800
He's simply kind.

306
00:21:18,039 --> 00:21:20,530
Maybe, but in the shinobi world,
that's the same thing.

307
00:21:21,099 --> 00:21:22,850
Then I say let him be who he is.

308
00:21:22,950 --> 00:21:23,950
Let him be kind.

309
00:21:24,959 --> 00:21:25,710
Are you serious?

310
00:21:25,850 --> 00:21:26,850
Be kind?

311
00:21:27,310 --> 00:21:27,830
Yes.

312
00:21:28,250 --> 00:21:33,570
The kindness that he possesses is a unique
weapon that he, and only he, has.

313
00:21:34,854 --> 00:21:35,854
A weapon?

314
00:21:36,270 --> 00:21:37,450
He's just a boy.

315
00:21:37,810 --> 00:21:40,690
It can't be helped if his kindness is seen
as cowardice.

316
00:21:41,669 --> 00:21:44,590
But someday, his kindness will be a thing
of greatness.

317
00:21:45,350 --> 00:21:47,223
The time will come
when the Hidden Leaf will

318
00:21:47,224 --> 00:21:50,071
need the kindness that
he brings to the world.

319
00:21:50,630 --> 00:21:54,630
However, he's also going to need to have
strength that can rival that kindness.

320
00:21:54,631 --> 00:22:00,110
He needs to have the intensity to
recognize, feel, and accept others' pain.

321
00:22:00,634 --> 00:22:04,370
Or even reject it, but still envelop them
in his kindness.

322
00:22:04,970 --> 00:22:07,330
I know that boy has those qualities.

323
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:09,950
Asuma...

324
00:22:10,784 --> 00:22:14,330
Choza is going to experience many things,
both good and bad.

325
00:22:14,670 --> 00:22:18,870
This is the shinobi world, after all,
so he'll have to face many hardships.

326
00:22:19,449 --> 00:22:23,070
But with each experience he has,
he will grow stronger and kinder.

327
00:22:35,270 --> 00:22:36,390
Asuma won't be the only one.

328
00:22:46,230 --> 00:22:47,230
Huh?

329
00:22:57,679 --> 00:22:59,070
Today's the day, so...

330
00:23:02,254 --> 00:23:03,254
Let's chow down.

331
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:37,080
Sakura, isn't it time for you to get
going?

332
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:39,000
I know!

333
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:40,400
I'm on my way out now!

334
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:44,620
How long are you going to treat me like a
kid?

335
00:23:44,680 --> 00:23:45,760
I'm a ninja now!

336
00:23:49,300 --> 00:23:52,800
So... I'm not a little academy student
anymore.

337
00:23:53,320 --> 00:23:55,280
I'm Sakura Haruno.

338
00:23:55,874 --> 00:23:57,040
Kunoichi in training.

339
00:23:57,420 --> 00:23:58,420
See you later!

340
00:24:05,940 --> 00:24:07,760
Good morning, Sakura.

341
00:24:09,169 --> 00:24:10,169
Good morning, Ino.

342
00:24:17,600 --> 00:24:19,780
So they actually let you graduate?

343
00:24:19,920 --> 00:24:20,700
What a surprise.

344
00:24:20,701 --> 00:24:23,180
Those classes are ancient history.

345
00:24:23,480 --> 00:24:25,980
We're both ninja now and we're both equal.

346
00:24:26,840 --> 00:24:28,640
I won't lose to you anymore.

347
00:24:29,280 --> 00:24:30,280
So!

348
00:24:34,740 --> 00:24:35,740
So!

349
00:24:41,300 --> 00:24:41,840
So!

350
00:24:42,180 --> 00:24:43,180
So!

351
00:24:43,740 --> 00:24:44,280
So!

352
00:24:44,480 --> 00:24:44,480
So!

353
00:24:44,580 --> 00:24:45,580
So!

354
00:24:51,160 --> 00:24:52,740
What are you doing here, Naruto?

355
00:24:53,300 --> 00:24:54,640
This isn't for dropouts.

356
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:56,300
You can't be here unless you graduate.

357
00:24:56,560 --> 00:24:57,180
Oh yeah?

358
00:24:57,280 --> 00:24:57,960
Do you see this?

359
00:24:57,961 --> 00:24:58,480
Do you see this?

360
00:24:58,560 --> 00:24:59,640
Open your eyes, Shikamaru.

361
00:24:59,700 --> 00:25:00,800
It's a regulation headband.

362
00:25:01,540 --> 00:25:02,980
We're going to be training together!

363
00:25:03,180 --> 00:25:04,180
How do you like that?

364
00:25:04,560 --> 00:25:05,560
Heh.

365
00:25:06,080 --> 00:25:07,460
Let me put it to you this way.

366
00:25:07,540 --> 00:25:08,920
I look great in this headgear.

367
00:25:08,940 --> 00:25:09,980
Like it was made for me.

368
00:25:10,040 --> 00:25:11,040
Believe it!

369
00:25:12,400 --> 00:25:14,520
Naruto, you graduated after all.

370
00:25:14,860 --> 00:25:15,860
I'm glad.

371
00:25:17,500 --> 00:25:17,900
I'm glad.

372
00:25:18,200 --> 00:25:19,520
I'm glad.

373
00:25:19,521 --> 00:25:20,521
I'm glad.

374
00:25:24,400 --> 00:25:25,400
I'm first!

375
00:25:28,400 --> 00:25:30,140
I won again, Sakura.

376
00:25:30,520 --> 00:25:31,520
Give it up.

377
00:25:31,860 --> 00:25:33,820
I had to look back to see you.

378
00:25:33,840 --> 00:25:35,660
My toe was at least a tenth of an inch
ahead.

379
00:25:35,860 --> 00:25:37,840
Have you always been this delusional?

380
00:25:40,440 --> 00:25:41,440
Sakura...

381
00:25:46,400 --> 00:25:47,820
She's smiling at me.

382
00:25:47,900 --> 00:25:49,880
I think she likes me in this headband.

383
00:25:51,820 --> 00:25:52,720
Hey, whoa!

384
00:25:52,840 --> 00:25:53,560
Where are you going?

385
00:25:53,800 --> 00:25:54,540
Hi, Sakura.

386
00:25:54,620 --> 00:25:55,020
What's up?

387
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:56,200
Move it!

388
00:25:57,840 --> 00:25:59,380
Good morning, Sasuke.

389
00:26:03,939 --> 00:26:05,380
Mind if I sit next to you?

390
00:26:06,349 --> 00:26:07,460
Back off, forehead!

391
00:26:07,760 --> 00:26:09,100
I'm sitting next to Sasuke.

392
00:26:09,559 --> 00:26:10,559
I was here first.

393
00:26:11,119 --> 00:26:12,920
I walked into the classroom before you
did.

394
00:26:13,020 --> 00:26:14,020
Everybody saw it.

395
00:26:14,140 --> 00:26:14,660
Dream on.

396
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:17,440
Actually, I got here before either of you.

397
00:26:17,500 --> 00:26:18,080
So did I.

398
00:26:18,220 --> 00:26:19,460
I'm sitting next to Sasuke.

399
00:26:19,660 --> 00:26:20,660
No, I am!

400
00:26:22,420 --> 00:26:23,420
Clueless.

401
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:28,440
Naruto!

402
00:26:32,440 --> 00:26:34,520
He stopped glaring at Sasuke!

403
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:37,000
Sakura?

404
00:26:37,639 --> 00:26:39,300
Why are they so obsessed with him?

405
00:26:39,460 --> 00:26:40,020
Sasuke!

406
00:26:40,320 --> 00:26:40,880
Sasuke!

407
00:26:41,140 --> 00:26:43,020
What's the big deal with this guy?

408
00:26:47,280 --> 00:26:47,760
Sasuke!

409
00:26:47,760 --> 00:26:47,760
Sasuke!

410
00:26:47,760 --> 00:26:47,760
Sasuke!

411
00:26:47,761 --> 00:26:48,480
Don't let him have it!

412
00:26:48,481 --> 00:26:48,860
Don't let him have it!

413
00:26:48,861 --> 00:26:50,196
You are going to get stuck in the future?

414
00:26:50,220 --> 00:26:50,480
Of course, Sasuke!

415
00:26:50,540 --> 00:26:50,620
We will!

416
00:26:51,060 --> 00:26:51,540
Wow!

417
00:26:51,820 --> 00:26:52,180
Haha!

418
00:26:52,181 --> 00:26:53,181
This is great!

419
00:26:53,280 --> 00:26:54,660
Sorry, did I bump you?

420
00:26:54,900 --> 00:26:55,900
What the...

421
00:26:56,389 --> 00:26:59,180
I, uhh... I, uhh...
I, uhh... I, uhh...

422
00:26:59,700 --> 00:27:01,181
I, uh... Uaah!

423
00:27:01,220 --> 00:27:02,220
Uaah!

424
00:27:05,460 --> 00:27:05,940
Shou!

425
00:27:06,040 --> 00:27:07,040
This is outrageous!

426
00:27:07,420 --> 00:27:09,340
I was supposed to be Sasuke's first kiss!

427
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:10,920
Naruto will pay for this!

428
00:27:11,040 --> 00:27:12,040
Shou!

429
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:15,700
I'll get you, Naruto!

430
00:27:16,540 --> 00:27:18,360
They are vicious!

431
00:27:20,560 --> 00:27:21,560
Danger!

432
00:27:24,480 --> 00:27:26,880
Naruto, you are so dead!

433
00:27:27,240 --> 00:27:27,960
Hey, whoa!

434
00:27:28,260 --> 00:27:29,400
It was an accident!

435
00:27:30,980 --> 00:27:32,160
You're finished!

436
00:27:32,700 --> 00:27:33,700
Hold on!

437
00:27:35,029 --> 00:27:36,580
As of today, you are all ninjas.

438
00:27:36,660 --> 00:27:39,220
To get here, you've faced difficult trials
and hardships.

439
00:27:39,221 --> 00:27:40,500
But that's nothing.

440
00:27:40,809 --> 00:27:42,720
What comes next will be far more
difficult.

441
00:27:43,109 --> 00:27:45,340
Now you are only Genin, first-level
ninjas.

442
00:27:45,749 --> 00:27:48,120
All the Genin will be grouped into
three-man squads.

443
00:27:48,399 --> 00:27:51,200
Each squad will be led by a Jonin,
an elite ninja.

444
00:27:52,195 --> 00:27:54,567
We want each squad to
have a balance of strengths

445
00:27:54,568 --> 00:27:57,281
and abilities, so that's
how we set them up.

446
00:27:57,880 --> 00:27:59,640
I will now announce the squads.

447
00:28:00,820 --> 00:28:01,820
Squad 7.

448
00:28:02,580 --> 00:28:04,240
Naruto Uzumaki.

449
00:28:05,260 --> 00:28:06,660
Sakura Haruno.

450
00:28:08,400 --> 00:28:09,400
Yay!

451
00:28:09,740 --> 00:28:10,920
I'm doomed.

452
00:28:11,760 --> 00:28:13,660
And Sasuke Uchiha.

453
00:28:15,780 --> 00:28:16,840
I'm doomed.

454
00:28:21,800 --> 00:28:23,840
I won't be with Naruto, then.

455
00:28:25,159 --> 00:28:26,680
Next, Squad 8.

456
00:28:26,860 --> 00:28:27,860
Hinata Yuga.

457
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:30,080
Yes, sir.

458
00:28:30,240 --> 00:28:31,400
Kiba Inuzuka.

459
00:28:32,500 --> 00:28:33,860
Shino Aburame.

460
00:28:37,660 --> 00:28:40,160
How did you get in his group?

461
00:28:41,940 --> 00:28:42,400
Ka-ching!

462
00:28:42,520 --> 00:28:44,020
True love conquers all!

463
00:28:46,000 --> 00:28:47,460
I don't get it.

464
00:28:47,480 --> 00:28:49,020
What do you see in a guy like that?

465
00:28:49,220 --> 00:28:50,380
He's not so special.

466
00:28:50,680 --> 00:28:52,780
You are so beyond clueless, Shikamaru.

467
00:28:52,940 --> 00:28:53,940
Don't you get it?

468
00:28:54,400 --> 00:28:56,760
No, I don't get it, because I'm not a
girl.

469
00:28:59,020 --> 00:29:00,620
You are so full of yourself.

470
00:29:01,760 --> 00:29:02,940
Jealousy is a terrible thing.

471
00:29:03,040 --> 00:29:04,320
I'd hate to be on your squad.

472
00:29:05,360 --> 00:29:06,360
Now, Squad 10.

473
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:08,480
Ino Yamanaka.

474
00:29:09,620 --> 00:29:10,420
Shikamaru Nara.

475
00:29:10,421 --> 00:29:14,300
Did you say something about hating to be
on my squad?

476
00:29:16,460 --> 00:29:18,360
And Choji Akimichi.

477
00:29:21,700 --> 00:29:23,260
Not Food Boy, too!

478
00:29:26,780 --> 00:29:28,220
Those are all the squads.

479
00:29:28,340 --> 00:29:30,908
Iruka-sensei, why does
a great ninja like me have

480
00:29:30,909 --> 00:29:33,680
to be in the same group
with a slug like Sasuke?

481
00:29:35,360 --> 00:29:38,140
Sasuke had the best scores of all the
graduating students.

482
00:29:38,900 --> 00:29:41,080
Naruto, you had the worst scores.

483
00:29:41,780 --> 00:29:46,060
To create a balanced group, we put the
best student with the worst student.

484
00:29:46,520 --> 00:29:50,020
Just make sure you don't get in my way,
loser.

485
00:29:51,580 --> 00:29:53,060
Hey, what did you say?

486
00:29:53,380 --> 00:29:54,380
Hard of hearing.

487
00:29:54,760 --> 00:29:56,100
Knock it off, Naruto!

488
00:29:56,380 --> 00:29:57,380
Sit down!

489
00:29:57,500 --> 00:30:01,260
After lunch, you'll meet your new Jonin
teachers.

490
00:30:01,620 --> 00:30:03,180
Until then, class dismissed.

491
00:30:08,349 --> 00:30:09,660
What a pain.

492
00:30:10,914 --> 00:30:13,860
I get into the same group as Sakura,
and he's gotta be in it, too.

493
00:30:14,624 --> 00:30:16,460
There's got to be a way to deal with this.

494
00:30:17,860 --> 00:30:18,860
Huh?

495
00:30:24,160 --> 00:30:25,160
Got it!

496
00:30:32,840 --> 00:30:33,280
Naruto!

497
00:30:33,780 --> 00:30:34,780
Sit down!

498
00:30:44,199 --> 00:30:46,580
Well, it's not like there's a big rush or
anything.

499
00:30:47,499 --> 00:30:50,260
I'll be in the same group as Sasuke for a
long time.

500
00:30:52,540 --> 00:30:53,540
But still...

501
00:30:53,849 --> 00:30:57,820
How could I even think he'd like me?

502
00:30:58,120 --> 00:31:01,520
Let's face it, I'm scrawny and small,
except for my forehead.

503
00:31:02,234 --> 00:31:04,400
Why was I born with such a big,
wide forehead?

504
00:31:12,500 --> 00:31:15,580
Sasuke... he's looking... right at me.

505
00:31:16,649 --> 00:31:18,960
That look in his eyes...

506
00:31:20,460 --> 00:31:23,540
Sakura, your forehead is so wide and
charming.

507
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:26,960
It makes me... feel like kissing it.

508
00:31:27,840 --> 00:31:29,920
Well, there's lots of room up there.

509
00:31:33,060 --> 00:31:34,720
Well, there's lots of room up there.

510
00:31:35,069 --> 00:31:36,040
Well, there's lots of room up there.

511
00:31:36,041 --> 00:31:38,300
I'm not a fairy tale, and fairy tales
don't come true.

512
00:31:39,099 --> 00:31:42,600
Sakura, your forehead is so wide and
charming...

513
00:31:45,349 --> 00:31:47,200
It makes me feel like kissing it.

514
00:31:54,020 --> 00:31:55,220
Ka-ching!

515
00:31:55,300 --> 00:31:56,300
She scores!

516
00:31:56,600 --> 00:31:58,420
This fairy tale is for real!

517
00:31:58,700 --> 00:31:59,700
Just kidding.

518
00:32:00,309 --> 00:32:02,420
That's the kind of dumb thing that Naruto
would say.

519
00:32:02,700 --> 00:32:03,700
Ugh...

520
00:32:04,239 --> 00:32:05,480
I wanna ask you something.

521
00:32:06,180 --> 00:32:07,180
Huh?

522
00:32:10,419 --> 00:32:11,819
Naruto... what do you think of him?

523
00:32:13,539 --> 00:32:16,780
He knows about my feelings, and he
purposely tries to get in the way.

524
00:32:17,639 --> 00:32:20,280
He enjoys interfering and making me feel
bad.

525
00:32:21,195 --> 00:32:24,820
Naruto... he doesn't understand one single
thing about me.

526
00:32:26,939 --> 00:32:27,939
He's just annoying.

527
00:32:29,289 --> 00:32:33,000
All I really want... is for you to accept
me, Sasuke.

528
00:32:33,160 --> 00:32:34,160
That's all.

529
00:32:35,079 --> 00:32:36,820
You just want me to accept you?

530
00:32:38,859 --> 00:32:40,120
Yes, that's how I feel.

531
00:32:41,474 --> 00:32:42,760
I'd do anything for that.

532
00:32:52,349 --> 00:32:54,420
I let my guard down.

533
00:32:57,730 --> 00:32:58,320
It's true.

534
00:32:58,680 --> 00:32:59,680
I'm desperate.

535
00:33:00,925 --> 00:33:04,720
I finally know why... why I like Sakura so
much.

536
00:33:04,920 --> 00:33:06,760
I finally understand.

537
00:33:10,800 --> 00:33:11,480
I found my stomach.

538
00:33:11,480 --> 00:33:11,480
Ah!

539
00:33:11,481 --> 00:33:12,920
My stomach!

540
00:33:13,100 --> 00:33:14,100
What timing!

541
00:33:15,620 --> 00:33:16,240
Ah!

542
00:33:16,560 --> 00:33:16,940
Hey!

543
00:33:17,140 --> 00:33:18,140
What's the matter?

544
00:33:19,100 --> 00:33:20,540
I'll be right back!

545
00:33:21,260 --> 00:33:23,740
I didn't know that Sasuke was so shy.

546
00:33:25,280 --> 00:33:27,660
Maybe he needs a little time to get ready.

547
00:33:28,730 --> 00:33:29,040
Ah!

548
00:33:29,220 --> 00:33:30,220
Ah.

549
00:33:33,500 --> 00:33:34,500
Close.

550
00:33:34,600 --> 00:33:35,600
Really close.

551
00:33:35,994 --> 00:33:39,620
My stomach was so upset, I almost lost
control of the jutsu.

552
00:33:39,621 --> 00:33:41,380
Why did it have to happen right then?

553
00:33:41,480 --> 00:33:46,920
Just when she was about to...
She thinks that I'm annoying?

554
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:48,780
She said that three times.

555
00:33:50,144 --> 00:33:54,060
I transform into Sasuke, get close to
Sakura, and she has to say that?

556
00:34:01,740 --> 00:34:02,740
Sasuke, you're back!

557
00:34:03,309 --> 00:34:05,000
Don't be so shy, you bad boy!

558
00:34:06,049 --> 00:34:06,700
Are you ready now?

559
00:34:06,800 --> 00:34:07,916
You know, mentally prepared?

560
00:34:07,940 --> 00:34:10,239
Because I am, I mean, I'm raring to go!

561
00:34:11,709 --> 00:34:12,820
Hey, wait a minute!

562
00:34:15,800 --> 00:34:16,800
Where's Naruto?

563
00:34:16,950 --> 00:34:19,500
Oh, see, there you go, changing the
subject again.

564
00:34:20,070 --> 00:34:22,199
Anyway, Naruto just picks fights with you.

565
00:34:23,095 --> 00:34:24,295
You know why he's so annoying?

566
00:34:24,460 --> 00:34:25,700
Because he wasn't raised right.

567
00:34:25,980 --> 00:34:28,920
He doesn't have a mother or father,
no one to teach him right from wrong.

568
00:34:29,960 --> 00:34:32,560
Think about it, he just does whatever
comes into his head.

569
00:34:33,515 --> 00:34:36,159
If I did things like Naruto, forget it!

570
00:34:36,300 --> 00:34:40,360
I mean, my parents would get mad and I'd
get in trouble, so of course I don't do it!

571
00:34:40,540 --> 00:34:41,840
But if you don't have parents...

572
00:34:41,860 --> 00:34:43,715
If you don't have parents to tell you,
how would you know?

573
00:34:43,739 --> 00:34:46,239
He's selfish and bratty!

574
00:34:46,300 --> 00:34:47,860
He's all alone!

575
00:34:48,300 --> 00:34:49,300
Alone.

576
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:50,400
Isolated.

577
00:34:50,580 --> 00:34:50,760
Huh?

578
00:34:51,040 --> 00:34:53,360
It's not about your parents scolding you.

579
00:34:53,460 --> 00:34:55,659
You have no idea what it means to be
alone.

580
00:34:56,120 --> 00:34:58,140
Wh-why are you saying that?

581
00:35:00,020 --> 00:35:01,560
Because you're annoying.

582
00:35:14,170 --> 00:35:16,090
So this is where Naruto lives.

583
00:35:17,055 --> 00:35:21,110
Yes, he'll be on your team, along with
Sakura and Sasuke from the Uchiha clan.

584
00:35:21,350 --> 00:35:21,650
Yes, he'll be on your team, along with
Sakura and Sasuke from the Uchiha clan.

585
00:35:21,651 --> 00:35:21,750
Good luck.

586
00:35:21,751 --> 00:35:21,990
Yes, he'll be on your team, along with
Sakura and Sasuke from the Uchiha clan.

587
00:35:21,990 --> 00:35:21,990
Good luck.

588
00:35:22,010 --> 00:35:23,010
You'll need it.

589
00:35:27,310 --> 00:35:29,880
This milk is way past its expiration date.

590
00:35:33,750 --> 00:35:36,970
One sip of this and he'd be running to the
bathroom all day.

591
00:35:38,350 --> 00:35:40,830
Seems like this kid's just one big
problem.

592
00:35:45,930 --> 00:35:51,310
Naruto, just sit down!

593
00:35:51,550 --> 00:35:52,310
I don't want to!

594
00:35:52,430 --> 00:35:54,530
How come our teacher's the only one that's
late?

595
00:35:54,650 --> 00:35:55,190
I don't want to!

596
00:35:55,510 --> 00:35:55,990
How come our teacher's the only one that's
late?

597
00:35:55,991 --> 00:35:56,230
Leave it!

598
00:35:56,730 --> 00:35:59,688
The other group's already met
their new teachers and took off

599
00:35:59,689 --> 00:36:02,830
on some adventure or something,
and Iruka-sensei's gone too.

600
00:36:03,130 --> 00:36:04,210
We know, okay?

601
00:36:06,030 --> 00:36:07,630
Hey, what are you doing?

602
00:36:12,290 --> 00:36:13,290
Naruto!

603
00:36:14,370 --> 00:36:16,070
That's what he gets for coming late.

604
00:36:16,350 --> 00:36:17,350
Surprise!

605
00:36:21,770 --> 00:36:23,190
You're asking for trouble.

606
00:36:23,310 --> 00:36:24,590
You know you shouldn't do that.

607
00:36:25,990 --> 00:36:27,750
I love stuff like this!

608
00:36:28,190 --> 00:36:28,350
Hm.

609
00:36:28,570 --> 00:36:31,010
Our teacher's a Jounin, an elite ninja.

610
00:36:31,310 --> 00:36:32,550
You think he'd fall for that?

611
00:36:32,870 --> 00:36:34,090
Yeah, Sasuke's right.

612
00:36:34,310 --> 00:36:35,610
You're so clueless, Naruto.

613
00:36:41,310 --> 00:36:42,570
I got him!

614
00:36:42,670 --> 00:36:43,870
He totally fell for it!

615
00:36:45,250 --> 00:36:46,730
I'm sorry, sensei.

616
00:36:46,810 --> 00:36:48,690
I told him not to do it, but he wouldn't
listen.

617
00:36:48,810 --> 00:36:50,610
I'd never do anything like that.

618
00:36:51,170 --> 00:36:52,170
Perfect shot!

619
00:36:53,390 --> 00:36:55,650
He actually fell for that cheap trick?

620
00:36:55,651 --> 00:36:57,510
Is this guy really a Jounin?

621
00:36:58,490 --> 00:36:59,050
Hm.

622
00:36:59,330 --> 00:37:00,610
How can I put this?

623
00:37:01,170 --> 00:37:03,350
My first impression of this group?

624
00:37:04,640 --> 00:37:05,730
You're a bunch of idiots.

625
00:37:08,930 --> 00:37:12,670
Alright, why don't you introduce
yourselves, one at a time?

626
00:37:13,519 --> 00:37:14,519
Introduce ourselves?

627
00:37:15,090 --> 00:37:17,150
Well, what are we supposed to say?

628
00:37:18,010 --> 00:37:19,210
Things you like.

629
00:37:19,370 --> 00:37:20,430
Things you hate.

630
00:37:21,070 --> 00:37:22,590
Dreams for the future.

631
00:37:23,090 --> 00:37:24,090
Hobbies.

632
00:37:24,210 --> 00:37:25,330
Things like that.

633
00:37:26,050 --> 00:37:27,830
Why don't you tell us stuff first?

634
00:37:27,930 --> 00:37:31,510
I mean, before we talk, tell us about you
so we can see how it's supposed to work.

635
00:37:33,070 --> 00:37:33,510
Me?

636
00:37:33,610 --> 00:37:34,850
I'm Kakashi Hatake.

637
00:37:36,030 --> 00:37:38,310
Things I like and things I hate.

638
00:37:39,550 --> 00:37:41,330
I don't feel like telling you that.

639
00:37:41,750 --> 00:37:42,750
Huh?

640
00:37:43,570 --> 00:37:45,190
My dreams for the future.

641
00:37:45,910 --> 00:37:47,350
Never really thought about it.

642
00:37:47,870 --> 00:37:51,090
As for my hobbies... I have lots of
hobbies.

643
00:37:51,630 --> 00:37:52,890
That was totally useless.

644
00:37:52,990 --> 00:37:54,590
All he really told us was his name.

645
00:37:56,255 --> 00:37:57,410
Okay, your turn.

646
00:37:57,550 --> 00:37:58,590
You on the right.

647
00:37:58,730 --> 00:37:59,730
You first.

648
00:38:00,550 --> 00:38:01,350
Believe it.

649
00:38:01,370 --> 00:38:02,970
I'm Naruto Uzumaki.

650
00:38:03,170 --> 00:38:05,010
I like instant ramen in a cup.

651
00:38:05,110 --> 00:38:09,670
And I really like the ramen Iruka-sensei
got me at the Ichiraku Noodle Shop.

652
00:38:09,990 --> 00:38:11,807
But I hate the three
minutes you have to wait

653
00:38:11,808 --> 00:38:13,650
after you pour the
water in the ramen cup.

654
00:38:13,790 --> 00:38:16,710
My hobby is eating different kinds of
ramen and comparing them.

655
00:38:16,850 --> 00:38:20,230
And my future dream is... to be the
greatest hokage!

656
00:38:20,550 --> 00:38:22,993
Then the whole village
will stop disrespecting

657
00:38:22,994 --> 00:38:24,570
me and start treating
me like I'm nothing.

658
00:38:24,571 --> 00:38:24,930
I'm somebody!

659
00:38:25,170 --> 00:38:26,170
Somebody important!

660
00:38:27,230 --> 00:38:30,470
Well, he's grown up in a very interesting
way.

661
00:38:32,645 --> 00:38:34,090
Alright, next.

662
00:38:34,510 --> 00:38:35,670
I'm Sakura Haruno.

663
00:38:36,010 --> 00:38:40,690
What I like, uh... I mean, the person I
like is...

664
00:38:42,110 --> 00:38:45,310
Uh, my hobby is, uh...

665
00:38:46,570 --> 00:38:49,330
My dream for the future is...

666
00:38:50,330 --> 00:38:51,330
And?

667
00:38:51,670 --> 00:38:53,090
What do you hate?

668
00:38:54,650 --> 00:38:55,650
Naruto!

669
00:38:57,690 --> 00:38:58,930
Last one.

670
00:38:59,410 --> 00:39:02,490
My name... is Sasuke Uchiha.

671
00:39:03,370 --> 00:39:04,850
I hate a lot of things.

672
00:39:05,515 --> 00:39:07,650
And I don't particularly like anything.

673
00:39:08,265 --> 00:39:11,970
What I have is not a dream.

674
00:39:12,250 --> 00:39:14,470
Because I will make it a reality.

675
00:39:15,030 --> 00:39:17,570
I'm going to restore my clan.

676
00:39:17,950 --> 00:39:21,310
And destroy a certain someone.

677
00:39:22,410 --> 00:39:23,870
Just as I thought.

678
00:39:24,550 --> 00:39:25,550
Good.

679
00:39:25,730 --> 00:39:27,770
You're each unique and you have your own
ideas.

680
00:39:28,750 --> 00:39:30,350
We'll have our first mission tomorrow.

681
00:39:31,784 --> 00:39:34,310
What kind of mission are we going to have?

682
00:39:35,590 --> 00:39:36,730
A survival exercise.

683
00:39:37,470 --> 00:39:38,010
Huh?

684
00:39:38,470 --> 00:39:39,470
Survival exercise?

685
00:39:39,930 --> 00:39:41,950
We already did this stuff at the academy.

686
00:39:42,070 --> 00:39:43,070
That's how we got here.

687
00:39:43,330 --> 00:39:45,690
This is not like your previous training.

688
00:39:46,030 --> 00:39:49,150
So, uh... so, uh... what kind of training
is it, then?

689
00:39:51,330 --> 00:39:52,330
Hehehehehehehehehehe.

690
00:39:53,310 --> 00:39:54,750
Hey, hold on.

691
00:39:55,005 --> 00:39:56,070
That's a normal question.

692
00:39:56,170 --> 00:39:57,170
What's so funny?

693
00:39:57,290 --> 00:40:01,290
Well, if I tell you the answer,
you're not going to like it.

694
00:40:02,290 --> 00:40:03,290
Huh?

695
00:40:04,030 --> 00:40:09,450
Of the 27 graduates who just came here,
only 9 will actually be accepted as Genin.

696
00:40:09,530 --> 00:40:13,510
The other 18 will be weeded out and sent
back to the academy.

697
00:40:13,870 --> 00:40:17,470
In other words, this is a
make-it-or-break-it pass-fail test.

698
00:40:17,730 --> 00:40:21,250
And the chance that you'll fail is at
least 66%.

699
00:40:23,930 --> 00:40:24,490
See?

700
00:40:24,491 --> 00:40:26,410
Didn't I tell you you wouldn't like it?

701
00:40:26,950 --> 00:40:27,950
That's crazy!

702
00:40:28,485 --> 00:40:29,630
We worked hard to get here!

703
00:40:29,870 --> 00:40:30,710
Believe it!

704
00:40:30,730 --> 00:40:33,070
What was that graduation test for,
anyway?

705
00:40:33,640 --> 00:40:34,370
Oh, that?

706
00:40:34,630 --> 00:40:37,790
That was just to select candidates who
might become Genin.

707
00:40:38,090 --> 00:40:38,770
Or not.

708
00:40:39,010 --> 00:40:40,010
What?!

709
00:40:41,000 --> 00:40:42,000
That's how it is.

710
00:40:42,660 --> 00:40:44,910
I decide whether you pass or fail.

711
00:40:45,670 --> 00:40:50,290
Be at the designated training spot at 5 AM
and bring your ninja gear.

712
00:40:52,970 --> 00:40:55,170
Well, I'm not going to be weeded out!

713
00:40:55,230 --> 00:40:57,010
People are going to look up to me someday!

714
00:40:57,270 --> 00:40:58,970
I've got to pass this test!

715
00:40:59,190 --> 00:40:59,830
Believe it!

716
00:41:00,010 --> 00:41:01,010
Believe it!

717
00:41:01,490 --> 00:41:04,650
If I fail, I'll be separated from Sasuke!

718
00:41:04,850 --> 00:41:06,950
This is a trial of love!

719
00:41:12,070 --> 00:41:12,710
That's it.

720
00:41:12,870 --> 00:41:13,870
You're dismissed.

721
00:41:14,390 --> 00:41:14,910
Oh.

722
00:41:15,350 --> 00:41:18,930
Tomorrow you better skip breakfast or
else... you'll puke.

723
00:41:31,040 --> 00:41:32,040
Marvelous.

724
00:41:46,310 --> 00:41:54,130
Go-go, Sasuke!

725
00:41:54,131 --> 00:41:55,970
Morning, everyone.

726
00:41:56,310 --> 00:41:57,650
Ready for your first day?

727
00:41:58,030 --> 00:41:59,050
Hey, you're late!

728
00:42:00,750 --> 00:42:03,990
Well, a black cat crossed my path,
so I had to take the long way.

729
00:42:08,920 --> 00:42:09,920
Well, let's get started.

730
00:42:10,320 --> 00:42:12,430
Here we go.

731
00:42:13,055 --> 00:42:14,055
It's set for noon.

732
00:42:15,830 --> 00:42:19,610
Your assignment is very simple.

733
00:42:20,050 --> 00:42:21,770
You just have to take these bells from me.

734
00:42:22,240 --> 00:42:23,280
That's all there is to it.

735
00:42:23,430 --> 00:42:25,830
If you can't get them by noon,
you go without lunch.

736
00:42:26,430 --> 00:42:30,870
You'll be tied to those posts and you'll
watch while I eat my lunch in front of you.

737
00:42:31,625 --> 00:42:32,990
So that's why.

738
00:42:33,330 --> 00:42:36,550
He told us not to eat breakfast to make it
harder on us.

739
00:42:36,710 --> 00:42:38,410
Wait a minute, there's three of us.

740
00:42:38,660 --> 00:42:40,150
How come there's only two bells?

741
00:42:40,399 --> 00:42:44,750
Well, that way, at least one of you will
end up tied to a post and ultimately

742
00:42:44,751 --> 00:42:47,150
disqualified for failing to complete the
mission.

743
00:42:48,160 --> 00:42:49,590
That one goes back to the Academy.

744
00:42:50,630 --> 00:42:53,970
Then again, all three of you could flunk
out, too.

745
00:42:54,870 --> 00:42:59,170
You can use any weapons, including
shuriken, if you're not prepared to get hit.

746
00:42:59,190 --> 00:43:01,410
If you kill me, you won't be able to take
the bells.

747
00:43:01,810 --> 00:43:04,210
Those weapons are too dangerous,
Sensei!

748
00:43:04,910 --> 00:43:07,590
Especially since you couldn't even dodge
that eraser.

749
00:43:08,130 --> 00:43:10,650
Class clowns are usually the weakest
links.

750
00:43:10,890 --> 00:43:12,350
You can safely ignore them.

751
00:43:12,630 --> 00:43:14,310
Lowest scores, losers.

752
00:43:15,590 --> 00:43:17,770
When I say start, you can begin.

753
00:43:23,790 --> 00:43:25,890
Losers, losers, losers.

754
00:43:31,110 --> 00:43:32,890
Don't be in such a hurry.

755
00:43:33,310 --> 00:43:35,370
I didn't say start yet.

756
00:43:37,190 --> 00:43:38,470
He's so fast!

757
00:43:39,055 --> 00:43:40,110
I didn't even see it.

758
00:43:41,140 --> 00:43:42,810
So this is it, Joninne...

759
00:43:43,360 --> 00:43:48,190
But you came at me with the full intention
of destroying me, so...

760
00:43:48,240 --> 00:43:52,590
how can I say this... I'm actually
starting to like you guys.

761
00:43:56,260 --> 00:43:57,260
Start!

762
00:44:01,620 --> 00:44:03,920
Ninja must know how to conceal their
trust.

763
00:44:19,360 --> 00:44:20,620
You and me!

764
00:44:20,720 --> 00:44:21,280
Right now!

765
00:44:21,400 --> 00:44:22,400
Fair and square!

766
00:44:22,580 --> 00:44:23,180
Let's go!

767
00:44:23,540 --> 00:44:24,540
Fool.

768
00:44:27,495 --> 00:44:30,180
You know, compared to the others,
you're a little bit... weird.

769
00:44:30,560 --> 00:44:31,140
Oh yeah?

770
00:44:31,260 --> 00:44:33,220
The only thing weird here is your haircut.

771
00:44:40,180 --> 00:44:41,180
Ah!

772
00:44:43,120 --> 00:44:44,120
Hmm...

773
00:44:45,620 --> 00:44:47,560
Shinobi Battle Techniques.

774
00:44:47,660 --> 00:44:48,680
Part 1.

775
00:44:50,060 --> 00:44:50,800
Taijutsu.

776
00:44:50,801 --> 00:44:52,240
The physical art.

777
00:44:53,680 --> 00:44:54,420
Ah!

778
00:44:54,421 --> 00:44:55,160
Taijutsu!

779
00:44:55,280 --> 00:44:56,720
That's hand-to-hand combat!

780
00:44:57,180 --> 00:44:59,260
Then why is he reaching for a weapon?

781
00:44:59,980 --> 00:45:05,960
What the...

782
00:45:08,380 --> 00:45:10,300
What are you waiting for?

783
00:45:10,400 --> 00:45:11,400
Make your move.

784
00:45:11,860 --> 00:45:14,840
But, I mean, why are you reading that
book?

785
00:45:15,760 --> 00:45:16,760
Why?

786
00:45:17,320 --> 00:45:20,060
To find out what happens in the story,
of course.

787
00:45:20,700 --> 00:45:21,820
Don't let it bother you.

788
00:45:21,880 --> 00:45:25,240
With your weak attacks, it doesn't really
matter if I'm reading or whatever.

789
00:45:28,040 --> 00:45:29,780
I'm going to crush you!

790
00:45:36,230 --> 00:45:37,530
Now you're mine!

791
00:45:39,190 --> 00:45:41,910
Don't let your enemy get behind you all
the time.

792
00:45:43,590 --> 00:45:45,670
A hand sign to focus his chakra.

793
00:45:45,990 --> 00:45:47,730
Is that the sign of the tiger?

794
00:45:47,910 --> 00:45:48,910
That's dangerous.

795
00:45:49,110 --> 00:45:50,910
He could destroy Naruto with that.

796
00:45:51,710 --> 00:45:54,390
That hand sign is for a fire jutsu.

797
00:45:54,730 --> 00:45:56,510
He's not just toying with Naruto.

798
00:45:56,770 --> 00:45:58,350
He's going to demolish him.

799
00:45:58,750 --> 00:45:59,210
Naruto!

800
00:45:59,510 --> 00:46:00,510
Get out of there, quick!

801
00:46:00,610 --> 00:46:02,050
He's going to destroy you!

802
00:46:02,610 --> 00:46:04,990
Leaf Village Secret Finger Jutsu!

803
00:46:05,250 --> 00:46:07,050
A thousand years of death!

804
00:46:08,410 --> 00:46:10,410
That wasn't a hand sign at all.

805
00:46:10,430 --> 00:46:11,430
He just poked him.

806
00:46:12,270 --> 00:46:12,830
Tuna!

807
00:46:12,831 --> 00:46:15,090
Those two are just total idiots.

808
00:46:20,090 --> 00:46:21,690
Okay, where was I?

809
00:46:24,370 --> 00:46:25,870
That must be against the rules.

810
00:46:25,990 --> 00:46:26,730
He's a Jonin.

811
00:46:26,830 --> 00:46:28,730
We can't possibly match his strength.

812
00:46:35,670 --> 00:46:37,670
I'm not going to let it end like this.

813
00:46:39,290 --> 00:46:40,730
I'll attack from the water.

814
00:46:41,050 --> 00:46:42,050
Now!

815
00:46:52,660 --> 00:46:54,180
What are you doing now?

816
00:46:54,420 --> 00:46:57,520
You know you won't get lunch unless you
take a bell by noon.

817
00:46:58,150 --> 00:46:59,480
I'll find the strength somehow.

818
00:46:59,940 --> 00:47:00,940
Believe it!

819
00:47:01,040 --> 00:47:04,820
I'm going to pass this test, and I'm not
going back to the academy.

820
00:47:05,200 --> 00:47:07,420
I will become a ninja!

821
00:47:11,700 --> 00:47:14,520
Hmm... I'm going
to get you, Master.

822
00:47:16,920 --> 00:47:18,860
You're overconfident, Sensei!

823
00:47:19,040 --> 00:47:22,880
That's why you weren't ready for a Shadow
Clone attack by Best Jutsu!

824
00:47:24,080 --> 00:47:25,440
Seven Naruto's?

825
00:47:29,440 --> 00:47:30,120
What?

826
00:47:30,400 --> 00:47:31,820
They're not images.

827
00:47:32,120 --> 00:47:33,120
They're real!

828
00:47:33,300 --> 00:47:35,300
How could he do that?

829
00:47:37,840 --> 00:47:38,840
Hmm...

830
00:47:41,140 --> 00:47:43,220
It looks like the stories are true.

831
00:47:43,440 --> 00:47:45,220
He can create Shadow Clones.

832
00:47:46,900 --> 00:47:50,860
Great technique, but I don't think you can
maintain it for very long.

833
00:47:51,980 --> 00:47:56,481
You talk like you're the best, Naruto,
but you're still the worst student.

834
00:47:57,849 --> 00:47:58,600
What?

835
00:47:58,840 --> 00:48:00,300
He got me from behind!

836
00:48:02,240 --> 00:48:03,240
What?

837
00:48:04,940 --> 00:48:05,280
He got me from behind!

838
00:48:05,281 --> 00:48:06,281
Hahahaha!

839
00:48:07,060 --> 00:48:09,560
Didn't you say don't let your enemies get
behind you?

840
00:48:09,680 --> 00:48:10,880
Good advice, Sensei!

841
00:48:10,900 --> 00:48:11,900
Believe it!

842
00:48:12,340 --> 00:48:17,401
I had one of my clones come out of the
river, then sneak up behind me, super quiet!

843
00:48:18,600 --> 00:48:21,580
Now this is for nailing me in the butt
earlier!

844
00:48:22,020 --> 00:48:24,220
When did Naruto get so cool?

845
00:48:24,460 --> 00:48:25,920
A diversionary tactic.

846
00:48:26,180 --> 00:48:27,180
Nice.

847
00:48:27,400 --> 00:48:28,400
Aaaaaah!

848
00:48:28,720 --> 00:48:30,640
You're mine, and so are those bells!

849
00:48:31,740 --> 00:48:32,740
Ugh!

850
00:48:36,660 --> 00:48:37,660
Aaaaah!

851
00:48:38,460 --> 00:48:39,460
Huh?

852
00:48:43,160 --> 00:48:44,160
Ouch!

853
00:48:48,000 --> 00:48:49,000
It's you!

854
00:48:49,690 --> 00:48:51,820
You're Kakashi Sensei, aren't you?

855
00:48:51,980 --> 00:48:54,320
You transformed into me using a jutsu!

856
00:48:54,540 --> 00:48:56,140
You are Kakashi Sensei!

857
00:48:56,220 --> 00:48:57,260
You smell like an old man!

858
00:48:57,320 --> 00:48:58,160
You must be him!

859
00:48:58,340 --> 00:48:59,460
You smell like an old man!

860
00:48:59,560 --> 00:49:00,140
You must be him!

861
00:49:00,340 --> 00:49:00,860
No, you are!

862
00:49:00,880 --> 00:49:02,360
No, you're Kakashi Sensei!

863
00:49:02,780 --> 00:49:03,220
Hey!

864
00:49:03,520 --> 00:49:04,660
Let's undo the jutsu!

865
00:49:04,780 --> 00:49:05,020
Yeah!

866
00:49:05,180 --> 00:49:05,740
That's it!

867
00:49:05,900 --> 00:49:06,460
Believe it!

868
00:49:06,860 --> 00:49:08,380
Then there'll be just two of us!

869
00:49:08,660 --> 00:49:09,660
I don't know who's who!

870
00:49:09,840 --> 00:49:11,600
Should've thought of that sooner,
fool!

871
00:49:11,980 --> 00:49:12,900
You're the jerk!

872
00:49:13,000 --> 00:49:14,160
Why didn't you think of it?

873
00:49:14,260 --> 00:49:15,600
Just undo the jutsu!

874
00:49:21,020 --> 00:49:22,020
Ugh...

875
00:49:23,730 --> 00:49:26,500
Naruto, you are so not cool.

876
00:49:27,060 --> 00:49:29,260
He got you with a replacement jutsu,
loser.

877
00:49:30,200 --> 00:49:34,660
With this jutsu, you quickly switch your
own body with an object, so your enemy

878
00:49:34,661 --> 00:49:38,640
thinks he's attacking you, when he's
actually attacking a log or rock.

879
00:49:38,641 --> 00:49:41,500
He made Naruto look like a total moron.

880
00:49:42,740 --> 00:49:43,740
Huh?

881
00:49:46,600 --> 00:49:47,600
A bell?

882
00:49:49,550 --> 00:49:51,060
I must've got to him with my attack!

883
00:49:51,580 --> 00:49:52,740
He dropped a bell!

884
00:49:55,220 --> 00:49:56,220
Hey!

885
00:49:59,220 --> 00:49:59,620
Hey!

886
00:49:59,780 --> 00:50:00,780
Let me down!

887
00:50:00,980 --> 00:50:01,980
What is this?

888
00:50:02,040 --> 00:50:03,800
Of course it was a trap.

889
00:50:04,020 --> 00:50:04,600
Help me!

890
00:50:04,601 --> 00:50:08,800
That Jounin doesn't let down his guard,
even when he's fighting a fool like Naruto.

891
00:50:09,120 --> 00:50:10,120
Come on!

892
00:50:14,580 --> 00:50:19,740
Think before you use a jutsu, or else your
opponent might use it against you.

893
00:50:20,020 --> 00:50:26,580
Oh, and also, if the bait is obvious,
don't take it.

894
00:50:29,020 --> 00:50:31,260
A ninja must see through deception.

895
00:50:31,640 --> 00:50:33,540
I... get... it!

896
00:50:34,180 --> 00:50:34,480
Ah!

897
00:50:34,481 --> 00:50:37,940
I'm telling you this because you don't get
it.

898
00:50:38,040 --> 00:50:41,640
You think you get it, which is not the
same as actually getting it.

899
00:50:41,720 --> 00:50:42,720
Get it?

900
00:50:43,060 --> 00:50:44,220
This is my chance!

901
00:50:44,900 --> 00:50:46,700
He finally dropped his guard!

902
00:50:49,540 --> 00:50:51,000
Won't you ever learn.

903
00:50:54,100 --> 00:50:56,520
He just got blasted by Shuriken!

904
00:50:56,740 --> 00:50:58,460
Are you out of your mind, Sasuke?

905
00:50:58,660 --> 00:50:59,740
You went too far!

906
00:51:11,900 --> 00:51:14,700
You've failed me.

907
00:51:15,320 --> 00:51:20,780
But if you'll stop me, Where's my sensei?

908
00:51:22,060 --> 00:51:23,060
I need to talk to him.

909
00:51:23,540 --> 00:51:24,860
I can't...

910
00:51:28,940 --> 00:51:30,740
I can't hear you, Sasuke.

911
00:51:30,741 --> 00:51:31,741
I'm going to be fine.

912
00:51:39,930 --> 00:51:42,170
A ninja must see through deception.

913
00:51:42,610 --> 00:51:43,410
Yeah, yeah!

914
00:51:43,550 --> 00:51:44,950
How am I supposed to do that?

915
00:51:45,810 --> 00:51:48,930
Well, I'm sure not falling for any more of
his traps!

916
00:51:54,130 --> 00:51:56,090
I fell for it again!

917
00:52:00,910 --> 00:52:01,910
Oh

918
00:52:17,360 --> 00:52:18,360
my!

919
00:52:20,040 --> 00:52:21,040
Someone there.

920
00:52:21,260 --> 00:52:23,300
I think I felt something.

921
00:52:23,360 --> 00:52:23,960
What was it?

922
00:52:24,340 --> 00:52:25,500
What's going on?

923
00:52:26,680 --> 00:52:28,040
Sakura... Sasuke!

924
00:52:29,900 --> 00:52:31,260
S-Sakura!

925
00:52:32,040 --> 00:52:33,040
Help me!

926
00:52:33,100 --> 00:52:34,240
Please help me!

927
00:52:45,350 --> 00:52:47,140
I think I overdid it a bit.

928
00:52:48,240 --> 00:52:49,240
Hm?

929
00:52:49,600 --> 00:52:51,020
Sounded like... Sakura?

930
00:52:52,020 --> 00:52:55,240
Shinobi battle skill number two,
the illusion jutsu.

931
00:52:55,550 --> 00:52:58,800
Sakura studied it in class, but she still
couldn't see it coming.

932
00:52:59,600 --> 00:53:00,600
Kenjutsu.

933
00:53:00,920 --> 00:53:02,480
It's just simple mind control.

934
00:53:03,500 --> 00:53:08,780
I'm not surprised he caught Sakura with
it, but... I'm not like Sakura and Naruto.

935
00:53:10,180 --> 00:53:11,840
Say that after you get one of these.

936
00:53:11,860 --> 00:53:14,780
My Sasuke...

937
00:53:23,160 --> 00:53:25,780
There's no point using normal attacks!

938
00:53:28,160 --> 00:53:29,480
A trap!

939
00:53:41,880 --> 00:53:43,970
This kid.

940
00:53:47,060 --> 00:53:47,370
..

941
00:53:53,510 --> 00:53:54,510
He's fierce.

942
00:53:54,690 --> 00:53:55,070
Hm.

943
00:53:55,250 --> 00:53:57,890
I won't be able to read Make Out Paradise
now.

944
00:53:59,810 --> 00:54:01,370
What... What happened?

945
00:54:04,530 --> 00:54:05,090
Sasuke!

946
00:54:05,310 --> 00:54:06,310
I saw him!

947
00:54:06,430 --> 00:54:08,050
He was on the verge of... No!

948
00:54:09,350 --> 00:54:10,350
Sasuke, no!

949
00:54:10,510 --> 00:54:12,270
You've got to survive, please!

950
00:54:13,120 --> 00:54:14,210
Where are you?

951
00:54:17,890 --> 00:54:18,890
Hmm... Hmm...

952
00:54:19,450 --> 00:54:20,450
Huh?

953
00:54:20,810 --> 00:54:21,810
Hey!

954
00:54:22,180 --> 00:54:23,530
What are those things down there?

955
00:54:24,690 --> 00:54:25,690
Ah!

956
00:54:28,310 --> 00:54:29,510
I know what those things are!

957
00:54:29,570 --> 00:54:30,650
Those are boxed lunches!

958
00:54:32,384 --> 00:54:35,170
Oh... A ninja must see through deception!

959
00:54:36,330 --> 00:54:42,550
Well, you are different from the other
two, I'll grant you that.

960
00:54:43,130 --> 00:54:44,130
Hmph.

961
00:54:46,410 --> 00:54:47,410
Horse!

962
00:54:47,570 --> 00:54:48,570
Tiger!

963
00:54:48,710 --> 00:54:49,730
Fire style!

964
00:54:50,250 --> 00:54:51,550
Fireball jutsu!

965
00:54:51,551 --> 00:54:52,270
What?

966
00:54:52,550 --> 00:54:54,790
Genin can't do fire jutsu.

967
00:54:54,791 --> 00:54:55,791
Takes too much chakra.

968
00:54:55,930 --> 00:54:56,930
There's no way.

969
00:55:12,550 --> 00:55:14,110
Where did he go?

970
00:55:14,250 --> 00:55:15,170
Behind me?

971
00:55:15,270 --> 00:55:16,270
Above?

972
00:55:22,070 --> 00:55:23,830
Right under your feet.

973
00:55:24,110 --> 00:55:25,110
Earth style.

974
00:55:25,500 --> 00:55:26,500
Headhunter jutsu.

975
00:55:27,760 --> 00:55:28,760
Can't move, huh?

976
00:55:28,950 --> 00:55:32,050
That was ninjutsu, the third shinobi
battle skill.

977
00:55:32,800 --> 00:55:34,690
You have talent, and you were right.

978
00:55:34,910 --> 00:55:37,010
You are... different from the others.

979
00:55:37,170 --> 00:55:39,030
But different isn't always better.

980
00:55:40,305 --> 00:55:44,090
They say the nail that sticks up is the
one that gets hammered down.

981
00:55:45,260 --> 00:55:48,530
Sensei told us that if we don't get a
bell, then we don't get any lunch.

982
00:55:48,650 --> 00:55:51,030
But if I eat my lunch now, then there's
nothing he can do!

983
00:55:51,560 --> 00:55:52,560
It's Chao time!

984
00:55:53,130 --> 00:55:54,130
Hi there.

985
00:55:54,770 --> 00:55:55,210
Aaaaaaah!

986
00:55:55,310 --> 00:55:57,950
I was just joking, Sensei.

987
00:55:58,210 --> 00:55:59,210
Nice try.

988
00:56:01,300 --> 00:56:02,510
He's stronger than I am.

989
00:56:03,045 --> 00:56:04,045
I can't get around that.

990
00:56:12,650 --> 00:56:13,650
Sakura?

991
00:56:17,390 --> 00:56:20,270
Sasuke's just a hand without a body and
he's talking!

992
00:56:24,140 --> 00:56:25,270
And that's my partner.

993
00:56:34,190 --> 00:56:34,670
Sasuke...

994
00:56:35,190 --> 00:56:35,810
You're okay!

995
00:56:35,930 --> 00:56:36,690
Hey, cut it out!

996
00:56:36,770 --> 00:56:37,150
Let go!

997
00:56:37,350 --> 00:56:38,350
Let go!

998
00:56:38,490 --> 00:56:40,290
I've got to get a bell before lunch.

999
00:56:40,870 --> 00:56:42,090
That doesn't leave much time.

1000
00:56:43,015 --> 00:56:45,710
Sasuke, you're still trying to get one of
those bells?

1001
00:56:46,265 --> 00:56:47,710
A while ago, I touched one.

1002
00:56:48,170 --> 00:56:49,450
Next time, I'll get one.

1003
00:56:50,890 --> 00:56:52,050
That is really great.

1004
00:56:52,390 --> 00:56:54,130
I can't believe you did that.

1005
00:56:54,170 --> 00:56:55,170
You're amazing!

1006
00:56:55,720 --> 00:56:56,850
I can't believe it!

1007
00:56:56,970 --> 00:56:58,090
He touched one of the bells!

1008
00:56:58,210 --> 00:56:59,966
I'll never get my hands on one of those
things!

1009
00:56:59,990 --> 00:57:01,850
Which means Sasuke will pass and I won't!

1010
00:57:01,851 --> 00:57:03,091
And we'll be separated forever!

1011
00:57:03,250 --> 00:57:04,290
No, no, no, no, no!

1012
00:57:05,370 --> 00:57:06,970
Uh, it's almost lunch.

1013
00:57:07,230 --> 00:57:11,350
There's not really enough time left,
so maybe we should just give up.

1014
00:57:11,410 --> 00:57:12,950
And then try again next year.

1015
00:57:13,350 --> 00:57:14,350
All right.

1016
00:57:14,690 --> 00:57:15,690
Mm-hmm.

1017
00:57:20,210 --> 00:57:24,090
I'm the only one who can destroy that
person.

1018
00:57:27,130 --> 00:57:28,130
What?

1019
00:57:29,910 --> 00:57:30,670
Who?

1020
00:57:30,671 --> 00:57:32,370
You mean the sensei?

1021
00:57:33,350 --> 00:57:36,170
That day, I was crying.

1022
00:57:37,170 --> 00:57:38,910
When were you crying?

1023
00:57:40,310 --> 00:57:41,850
It was my...

1024
00:57:42,450 --> 00:57:43,450
What?

1025
00:57:44,070 --> 00:57:45,590
What happened to you?

1026
00:57:46,370 --> 00:57:48,050
I am an Avenger.

1027
00:57:48,051 --> 00:57:51,050
That means I must be stronger than my
prey.

1028
00:57:51,230 --> 00:57:52,810
I need this training.

1029
00:57:52,910 --> 00:57:54,230
There's no time for setbacks.

1030
00:57:57,690 --> 00:57:59,890
I wasted too much time.

1031
00:58:03,805 --> 00:58:04,805
Uh-oh.

1032
00:58:10,410 --> 00:58:11,790
Stomach's growling, huh?

1033
00:58:12,110 --> 00:58:13,110
That's too bad.

1034
00:58:13,600 --> 00:58:16,410
Oh, by the way, about this exercise...

1035
00:58:17,110 --> 00:58:18,470
Well, I've decided.

1036
00:58:18,471 --> 00:58:21,390
I won't send any of you back to the
Academy.

1037
00:58:28,340 --> 00:58:33,000
Yes, all three of you are being dropped
from the program.

1038
00:58:33,960 --> 00:58:34,960
Permanently.

1039
00:58:41,420 --> 00:58:43,300
Iruka, what did you wish to see me about?

1040
00:58:44,850 --> 00:58:48,400
I don't think you came here merely to
drink tea with me and chat, did you?

1041
00:58:49,054 --> 00:58:51,000
Naruto's been assigned to Squad Seven.

1042
00:58:52,455 --> 00:58:53,900
The Jonin in charge of that group.

1043
00:58:54,385 --> 00:58:55,880
Just how tough a trainer is he?

1044
00:58:57,450 --> 00:58:58,480
Kakashi, you mean.

1045
00:58:59,410 --> 00:59:00,820
You are concerned about him.

1046
00:59:01,520 --> 00:59:02,520
I am.

1047
00:59:03,000 --> 00:59:04,700
I heard a rumor about his training
methods.

1048
00:59:06,205 --> 00:59:07,205
Hmm...

1049
00:59:10,360 --> 00:59:11,360
What's this?

1050
00:59:12,630 --> 00:59:15,100
All the trainees who've ever been assigned
to him.

1051
00:59:15,200 --> 00:59:17,220
Those who passed and those who failed.

1052
00:59:18,720 --> 00:59:19,720
May I?

1053
00:59:23,000 --> 00:59:24,000
Huh?

1054
00:59:24,680 --> 00:59:25,680
This?

1055
00:59:26,260 --> 00:59:28,340
This is... Drop us
from the program?

1056
00:59:28,620 --> 00:59:30,280
That means we can never become ninja.

1057
00:59:30,460 --> 00:59:33,340
You said if we couldn't take the bells,
we'd be sent back to the Academy.

1058
00:59:33,500 --> 00:59:35,800
You can't just change your mind and kick
us out.

1059
00:59:35,820 --> 00:59:36,920
Why would you do that?

1060
00:59:37,060 --> 00:59:38,880
Because you don't think like ninja.

1061
00:59:39,100 --> 00:59:40,520
You think like little kids.

1062
00:59:40,980 --> 00:59:41,980
Like brats.

1063
00:59:47,160 --> 00:59:48,160
Satsuki!

1064
00:59:49,000 --> 00:59:50,880
You think it's all about you.

1065
00:59:52,760 --> 00:59:54,040
Let go, Sasuke!

1066
00:59:54,220 --> 00:59:56,000
You can't step on him like he's some bug!

1067
00:59:57,640 --> 00:59:58,840
Use your head.

1068
00:59:59,080 --> 01:00:00,940
Three people on a squad.

1069
01:00:01,160 --> 01:00:03,560
Why do you think we would do that?

1070
01:00:04,840 --> 01:00:05,360
Ah!

1071
01:00:05,800 --> 01:00:08,120
How are we supposed to know why you picked
three people?

1072
01:00:08,220 --> 01:00:09,240
We didn't make the rules!

1073
01:00:09,620 --> 01:00:10,640
It's so basic.

1074
01:00:11,500 --> 01:00:12,500
Teamwork.

1075
01:00:13,160 --> 01:00:17,780
If all three of you had come at me,
you might have been able to take them.

1076
01:00:19,080 --> 01:00:21,280
Well, anyway, it's over.

1077
01:00:21,980 --> 01:00:26,760
Wait a minute... You set it up with
three people, but only two bells.

1078
01:00:27,020 --> 01:00:30,540
If we worked together and got the bells,
only two of us could keep them,

1079
01:00:30,620 --> 01:00:33,420
and that would lead to group conflict and
the squad would break up.

1080
01:00:33,940 --> 01:00:34,940
Exactly.

1081
01:00:35,020 --> 01:00:37,960
I purposely pitted you against each other.

1082
01:00:39,160 --> 01:00:40,160
Huh?

1083
01:00:40,300 --> 01:00:45,160
I wanted to see if you could overcome that
and put the squad ahead of yourselves.

1084
01:00:45,161 --> 01:00:49,011
A genin should have a
natural feel for teamwork,

1085
01:00:49,012 --> 01:00:52,681
but you... it never
even crossed your mind.

1086
01:00:52,840 --> 01:00:58,240
Sakura, you obsessed about Sasuke,
who was gone, while Naruto was right in

1087
01:00:58,241 --> 01:01:00,500
front of you and you wouldn't lift a
finger to help him.

1088
01:01:02,020 --> 01:01:05,120
Naruto, you do everything on your own.

1089
01:01:05,320 --> 01:01:06,320
Everything.

1090
01:01:06,520 --> 01:01:11,540
And you, Sasuke, thought the others were
so far beneath you they were worthless.

1091
01:01:12,180 --> 01:01:12,780
Arrogance.

1092
01:01:13,000 --> 01:01:15,140
Ninja missions are carried out in squads.

1093
01:01:15,141 --> 01:01:20,140
Of course, you need individual skills, but
teamwork is the most essential element.

1094
01:01:20,400 --> 01:01:22,580
Every shinobi understands this.

1095
01:01:22,840 --> 01:01:28,260
When individuals put themselves above the
squad, this can lead to failure and death.

1096
01:01:28,720 --> 01:01:34,020
For example... Sakura, kill
Naruto now or Sasuke dies.

1097
01:01:37,760 --> 01:01:39,580
That's what happens on a mission.

1098
01:01:42,280 --> 01:01:45,120
The enemy takes a hostage and you've got
an enemy.

1099
01:01:45,140 --> 01:01:47,900
It's an impossible choice, and someone
ends up dead.

1100
01:01:49,034 --> 01:01:51,760
On every mission, your life is on the
line.

1101
01:01:53,580 --> 01:01:54,660
Did you look at this stone?

1102
01:01:55,085 --> 01:01:56,700
The names engraved on it?

1103
01:01:59,190 --> 01:02:02,440
They are all ninja who are honored as
heroes in our village.

1104
01:02:04,180 --> 01:02:04,780
That's it!

1105
01:02:04,860 --> 01:02:05,240
That's it!

1106
01:02:05,280 --> 01:02:05,700
That's it!

1107
01:02:06,020 --> 01:02:07,020
Now I know!

1108
01:02:07,940 --> 01:02:10,720
I've decided I'm gonna have my name
engraved on that stone!

1109
01:02:11,140 --> 01:02:13,580
I'm not gonna live and die for nothing
like a dog!

1110
01:02:13,660 --> 01:02:14,880
I'm gonna be a hero!

1111
01:02:14,881 --> 01:02:15,881
A hero!

1112
01:02:17,130 --> 01:02:19,600
They are... a special kind of hero.

1113
01:02:19,840 --> 01:02:20,840
Huh?

1114
01:02:21,410 --> 01:02:22,600
What kind of heroes are they?

1115
01:02:22,700 --> 01:02:23,800
Come on, tell us!

1116
01:02:26,810 --> 01:02:27,940
Well, well...

1117
01:02:28,140 --> 01:02:30,180
They're all K.I.A.

1118
01:02:38,660 --> 01:02:40,940
This is a memorial stone.

1119
01:02:41,820 --> 01:02:44,540
The names of my closest friends are
engraved here.

1120
01:02:50,720 --> 01:02:51,760
My son!

1121
01:02:55,040 --> 01:02:59,720
Please tell me this was me who was raised
as a hero Alright, I'm going to give you

1122
01:02:59,721 --> 01:03:02,832
one more chance, but
I'm going to make it much

1123
01:03:02,833 --> 01:03:06,481
harder on you you have
three hours to get a bell.

1124
01:03:06,770 --> 01:03:11,120
Eat lunch now to build up strength but
Naruto doesn't get any.

1125
01:03:12,590 --> 01:03:15,920
It's your punishment for breaking the
rules and trying to eat by yourself.

1126
01:03:16,950 --> 01:03:21,320
And if anyone tries to feed him,
that person will immediately fail.

1127
01:03:21,825 --> 01:03:24,660
I make the rules.

1128
01:03:25,300 --> 01:03:26,420
You follow them.

1129
01:03:26,620 --> 01:03:27,620
Got it?

1130
01:03:40,960 --> 01:03:41,960
Here.

1131
01:03:44,820 --> 01:03:45,820
What?

1132
01:03:47,520 --> 01:03:49,400
No, Sasuke, you can't do that!

1133
01:03:49,580 --> 01:03:51,140
You heard what the sensei said!

1134
01:03:51,720 --> 01:03:52,720
Kakashi's gone.

1135
