We need to get those bells as a team.

1136
01:03:54,980 --> 01:03:57,580
If Naruto's hungry, he'll be weak and
ineffective.

1137
01:03:58,200 --> 01:04:00,900
That hurts the team and jeopardizes the
mission.

1138
01:04:03,300 --> 01:04:04,340
Um... Sasuke...

1139
01:04:13,380 --> 01:04:14,620
It can't be.

1140
01:04:14,880 --> 01:04:16,680
This is even worse than the rumors.

1141
01:04:18,144 --> 01:04:19,144
Kakashi is dead.

1142
