They all tried, but not one of them could
live up to Kakashi's standards.

1147
01:04:32,290 --> 01:04:34,060
So they were all... eliminated.

1148
01:04:38,140 --> 01:04:39,140
You!

1149
01:04:41,060 --> 01:04:42,060
You

1150
