1158
01:05:18,860 --> 01:05:20,800
You're the first squad that ever
succeeded.

1159
01:05:20,801 --> 01:05:25,020
The others did exactly what I said,
and fell into every trap.

1160
01:05:25,280 --> 01:05:26,860
They couldn't think for themselves.

1161
01:05:27,550 --> 01:05:30,260
A ninja must see through deception.

1162
01:05:30,820 --> 01:05:34,280
In the ninja world, those who break the
rules are scum.

1163
01:05:34,300 --> 01:05:35,300
That's true.

1164
01:05:36,340 --> 01:05:41,340
But... those who abandon their friends...
are worse than scum.

1165
01:05:43,320 --> 01:05:44,320
Hmm...

1166
01:05:48,580 --> 01:05:52,680
He's, uh... you know... he's kinda cool.

1167
01:05:53,500 --> 01:05:55,600
The exercise is over.

1168
01:05:55,760 --> 01:05:57,080
Everyone passes.

1169
