I get it!

1172
01:06:05,860 --> 01:06:06,480
I get it!

1173
01:06:06,481 --> 01:06:07,080
Believe it!

1174
01:06:07,140 --> 01:06:07,860
I'm a ninja!

1175
01:06:08,060 --> 01:06:08,520
Ninja!

1176
01:06:08,700 --> 01:06:09,700
Ninja!

1177
01:06:09,880 --> 01:06:11,080
Let's go home.

1178
01:06:11,340 --> 01:06:14,680
Show some love, and I'll make our during
the night.

1179
