Before you idealize, motivate your anger.

1186
01:06:50,260 --> 01:06:51,920
Make them all realize.

1187
01:06:52,180 --> 01:06:53,500
Climb in the mountain.

1188
01:06:53,900 --> 01:06:55,240
Never coming down.

1189
01:06:55,420 --> 01:06:57,180
Break into the contents.

1190
01:06:57,480 --> 01:06:58,720
Never falling down.

1191
01:07:02,100 --> 01:07:03,900
My knee is still shaking.

1192
01:07:04,140 --> 01:07:05,560
Like I was twelve.

1193
01:07:05,840 --> 01:07:07,400
Sneaking out the classroom.

1194
01:07:07,760 --> 01:07:08,960
By the back door.

1195
01:07:09,160 --> 01:07:10,860
A moral let me try some.

1196
01:07:11,340 --> 01:07:12,360
But I didn't care.

1197
01:07:12,700 --> 01:07:14,080
Waiting is wasting.

1198
01:07:14,500 --> 01:07:15,780
For people like me.

1199
01:07:16,920 --> 01:07:22,520
Don't try to look so wise Don't cry cause
you look so right.

1200
01:07:22,521 --> 01:07:26,020
Don't try to make some fears.

1201
01:07:26,280 --> 01:07:29,320
Cause you were Turtle in the end.

1202
01:07:38,800 --> 01:07:45,350
Don't try to look so wise Don't cry cause
you look so right.

